Nodemon in Node.js – Short Interview Notes

What is Nodemon:
Nodemon is a utility that automatically restarts a Node.js application when file changes in the directory are detected.

Why we need Nodemon:
Saves time – no need to manually stop and restart the server after every change.
Improves development workflow and productivity.
Especially useful during backend development and testing.

How to install:
npm install -g nodemon   # globally
npm install --save-dev nodemon  # locally as dev dependency

nodemon app.js
